WEBVTT

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.776
and pathways and role models ...

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:08.536
before there are policies
and ways to show us

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.000
how to go forward.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:14.176
We're in the middle of a seismic shift,

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.480
and we're going to have to find
bridgework to get us through.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.696
Bridgework is what we do in the meantime;

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.256
bridgework is what we do

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:25.840
while we're trying
to figure out what is next.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.056
Bridgework is also
letting go of this notion

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:33.656
that our worth and our value
depend on our income